    {
      "refs": [
        "branch:b1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the SAP Configuration is completed, it moves on to IT Design, Development & Functional Test. Similarly, after Communications Design, it moves on to Communications Deployment. After Learning Design, it proceeds to Learning Deployment."
